  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p177.s01",
     "source": "Saturday after Saturday did Mrs. Tiger go and look, but every time Jackal's house seemed to look more deserted; and after a while there was a spider's web over the door and the trail of Snake showed that he, too, had taken up his abode there."
    }
